      "title": "Image Preparation and Baselines for Surface Defect Classification",
      "bullets": [
        "Prepared surface inspection images by checking defect labels, standardizing crop dimensions, and separating training and evaluation sets by source object.",
        "Implemented assigned texture descriptor and linear classifier baselines, documenting preprocessing settings and reviewing confusion matrices for visually similar defect categories."
      ]
    }
